  "description": "object_type=public_status_schema; trust_zone=proposed; lifecycle_status=active; provenance_note=Created 2026-08-27 by Codex root; reason_for_inclusion=Publish honest progress, controls, and review debt without leaking private reasoning or claiming runtime or theology authority.",
  "type": "object",
